Test keys and signatures for src/signature.rs. Never use them for anything real.
The secret keys have no password and are public.

a.pub, b.pub        two key pairs (a.key, b.key are the secret halves)
data.txt            the signed file
data.txt.a.minisig        signed by a, trusted comment "irsync v1.2.3"
data.txt.b.minisig        signed by b, same comment
data.txt.old.minisig      signed by a, trusted comment "irsync v1.2.2"
data.txt.legacy.minisig   signed by a with minisign -l (not prehashed)
data.txt.corrupt.minisig  a signature with its second line cut short

To make them again, run ./regen.sh (needs minisign 0.10 or newer).
